WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:03.190
SCP-682 Vs SCP-217.

00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:08.570
Could the clockwork virus finally be “time’s
up” for this unkillable reptile?

00:00:08.570 --> 00:00:12.990
SCP-217 was pumped into SCP-682’s cell via
a gas pipe.

00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:16.480
At one second, SCP-682 was sitting still.

00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:19.689
At seven seconds, the gas was introduced to
the containment area.

00:00:19.689 --> 00:00:25.970
At 21 seconds, SCP-682 was coughing, as the
virus traveled into its respiratory system.

00:00:25.970 --> 00:00:31.039
For nine days after this, SCP-682 had no visible
response to the virus.

00:00:31.039 --> 00:00:38.720
However, at 224 hours, 36 minutes, and 24
seconds, SCP-682 began to howl with pain.

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:41.400
The roaring continued for 35 minutes and 48
seconds.

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:47.350
At this point, the screams began to quiet
until SCP-682 went completely silent, and

00:00:47.350 --> 00:00:49.010
appeared to be in shock.

00:00:49.010 --> 00:00:54.580
After 36 minutes, 682 began to laugh uproariously,
apparently having developed an immunity to

00:00:54.580 --> 00:00:55.480
the virus.

